			"fileName": "ResponseTimeChart.jsx",
			"wiki": "The user navigates to the monitor details page. The `ResponseTImeChart` component is rendered, which in turn renders the `MonitorDetailsAreaChart`. This component is responsible for displaying the historical response time data for the selected monitor and date range.",
			"cellName": "Render Response Time Chart - ResponseTimeChart.jsx:L13-21",
