		"server/src/controllers/v1/monitorController.js-simstep-ea711511-9104-4ad6-ae67-af23010d8ab3": {
			"path": "server/src/controllers/v1/monitorController.js-simstep-ea711511-9104-4ad6-ae67-af23010d8ab3",
			"fileName": "monitorController.js",
			"wiki": "The backend router receives the incoming GET request and directs it to the `getMonitorStatsById` method in the `monitorController`. This method validates the request parameters (`monitorId`) and query parameters (`dateRange`, `numToDisplay`, etc.) using Joi schemas to ensure they are in the correct format.",
			"cellName": "Backend: Receive and Validate Request - monitorController.js:L79-87",
			"cellId": "a1da512d-d98b-40a4-acd7-a97e14551c4d",
