			"fileName": "index.jsx",
			"wiki": "The `MonitorDetailsAreaChart` component receives the fetched monitor stats as props. It uses the `recharts` library to render an SVG area chart, plotting the average response time (`avgResponseTime`) over time. The component configures elements like the Cartesian grid, axes, tooltips, and the data-driven area plot.",
			"cellName": "Frontend: Render Chart with Data - index.jsx:L143-223",
			"cellId": "48e1c1e3-7f52-4bd6-9259-f033c666300d",
