			"fileName": "index.jsx",
			"wiki": "The `PageSpeedDetails` component receives the historical data and passes it as props to child components like `PageSpeedAreaChart` and `PerformanceReport`. These components use a charting library to visualize the trends in Performance, SEO, Accessibility, and other key metrics over time.",
			"cellName": "Frontend Renders Performance Charts - index.jsx:L107-119",
