			"fileName": "inviteRoute.js",
			"wiki": "The backend receives the request. The `inviteRoute` is protected by `verifyJWT` (ensuring the requester is logged in) and `isAllowed` (ensuring the requester is an 'admin' or 'superadmin') middleware before passing control to the controller.",
			"cellName": "Server Handles Invite Request - inviteRoute.js:L14",
			"cellId": "cd9ccc69-ca00-441a-bf55-92bfc2770aae",
			"visible": true,
