			"fileName": "monitorModule.js",
			"wiki": "The `monitorModule` receives the array of monitor data, maps each item to a `Monitor` model instance, and uses `bulkSave` to efficiently insert them into the database.",
			"cellName": "Flow 1: Database Module Performs Bulk Save - monitorModule.js:L465-471",
			"cellId": "755f734d-5b63-491e-8c3e-b63fd7bf7b40",
