			"description": "<ul><li>This is the core feature of the application, providing significant business value by ensuring service availability</li><li>- Users can add targets (websites, servers, ports) to be monitored at regular intervals</li><li>- The application checks if the target is online ('up' or 'down') and measures its response time</li><li>- Various monitor types are supported, including HTTP(S), Ping, Port, Docker containers, and Game servers</li><li>- Users can view a dashboard summarizing the status of all monitors and drill down into detailed historical data for each one</li></ul>",
