			"description": "<ul><li>Critical for timely incident response, this feature alerts users immediately when a monitored service's status changes</li><li>- Users can configure notification channels for alerts</li><li>- Supported channels include Email, Slack, Discord, Webhooks, and PagerDuty</li><li>- Notifications are automatically triggered when a service goes down or comes back up</li><li>- Users can associate specific notification channels with individual monitors</li></ul>",
