			"description": "<ul><li>This feature builds customer trust by transparently communicating the status of services</li><li>- Users can create customizable, public-facing status pages</li><li>- They can select which monitors to display on a given status page</li><li>- Status pages can be branded with a company name, logo, and custom colors</li><li>- Options are available to show uptime percentages and historical performance charts</li></ul>",
