			"description": "<ul><li>Extends monitoring beyond simple uptime to the health of the underlying server hardware, requiring a separate 'Capture' agent</li><li>- Users can monitor server metrics like CPU usage, memory consumption, disk space, and temperature</li><li>- Custom alert thresholds can be set for each hardware metric (e</li><li>g</li><li>, alert if CPU usage exceeds 90%)</li><li>- The application provides detailed dashboards with historical graphs for all hardware metrics</li><li>- This helps in proactive maintenance and capacity planning</li></ul>",
