			"description": "<ul><li>Allows users to understand performance trends and analyze historical data through visual dashboards</li><li>- Detailed views for each monitor present historical data in charts and graphs</li><li>- Key metrics like response time, uptime percentage, and incident history are visualized over selectable time frames (e</li><li>g</li><li>, last 24 hours, 7 days, 30 days)</li><li>- For infrastructure monitors, detailed charts for CPU, memory, and disk usage are available</li><li>- This visual data helps in identifying performance bottlenecks and reporting on service level agreements (SLAs)</li></ul>",
