			"description": "<ul><li>Provides a clear history of downtime events and allows for acknowledgment, forming a basic incident management workflow</li><li>- The system automatically logs an 'incident' whenever a monitor's status is 'down'</li><li>- An incidents dashboard lists all current and past downtime events across all monitors</li><li>- Users can view the duration of each incident and the history of checks during the outage</li><li>- Acknowledging a check ('ack') helps teams coordinate and track their response to an ongoing issue</li></ul>",
