			"description": "<ul><li>Prevents false alarms and alert fatigue by allowing users to schedule planned maintenance periods</li><li>- Users can create maintenance windows for specific monitors or groups of monitors</li><li>- During a scheduled maintenance window, all alerts for the affected monitors are paused</li><li>- Downtime during a maintenance window does not count against the overall uptime percentage</li><li>- Maintenance can be scheduled as a one-time event or on a recurring basis</li></ul>",
