			],
			"description": "<ul><li>Enables collaborative use of the application within an organization by managing users and permissions</li><li>- The application supports multiple users organized into teams</li><li>- Admins can invite new members to a team via email or an invite link</li><li>- Role-based access control (e</li><li>g</li><li>, admin, user) restricts permissions for creating/editing monitors and managing settings</li><li>- This is essential for secure and organized use in a business environment</li></ul>",
