			"description": "<ul><li>Streamlines the management of a large number of monitors, making the platform scalable for power users</li><li>- Users can import a list of monitors from a CSV file, enabling rapid setup</li><li>- A template is provided to ensure the CSV is correctly formatted for bulk import</li><li>- Existing monitor configurations can be exported to a CSV file for backup or migration purposes</li><li>- This feature is crucial for onboarding new teams or integrating with existing infrastructure-as-code workflows</li></ul>",
